Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.58,0:00:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.64,0:00:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.74,0:00:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.92,0:00:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.76,0:00:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there. You will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.84,0:01:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've prepared this extra nutritious\Nand fortifying meal just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.34,0:01:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we can get a healthy smile back\Non that beautiful face of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.68,0:01:59.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.62,0:02:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't recall you asking for\Npermission to use my kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam, I made a dish for you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's supposed to make you look years...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a swinging single still\Nin the prime of youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget it. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lee, save me from this loaded tank!\NWait, hold on! Come back! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's gonna join\Nus and be our friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.08,0:02:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't say I was gonna do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you did!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.73,0:02:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.65,0:02:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.62,0:02:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he only knew what friend means to\Nsomeone who's been through what Chopper has.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Chopper was out there on\Nhis own, there was only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,human that he ever really opened\Nup to that man's name was dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:03:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here look he was a crazy quack but he\Nnamed chopper and called him his son
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.83,0:03:07.79,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(1354,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(1312,1354,\1a&H00&)}Inherited Will
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.83,0:03:07.79,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(1354,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Inherited Will
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey you stop where'd he go he's\Nme he disappeared crazy quack
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've got to get him Those are Lord\NWaple's orders now move out, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go on like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.22,0:03:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to call a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no doctors left to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.42,0:03:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Except for the 20 MDs who belong to Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we have to beg Wapol on our knees for\Nhelp, then that's what we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need Waple's charity.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.25,0:03:57.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)}Dr. Hiriluk, Quack Doctor{Zenef}
Dialogue: 2,0:03:53.25,0:03:57.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\3c&HFFFFFE&\c&HFFFFFE&\1a&HFF&\t(442,484,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Dr. Hiriluk, Quack Doctor{Zenef}
Dialogue: 3,0:03:53.25,0:03:57.72,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(484,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&HFFFFFE&\4a&HFF&}Dr. Hiriluk, Quack Doctor{Zenef}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll examine him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine. It's just a cold. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the last bunch of patients you treated\NEnded up getting a whole lot worse Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no need to be shy\Nwith your doctor I just
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.72,0:04:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,developed a wonderful new\Nall-purpose drug yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a lucky man, now shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.41,0:04:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's not the kind\Nof gun you think it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a tranquilizer gun for\Npatients with severe pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get the soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want money, I'll be glad to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't take money from sick people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too young to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.46,0:04:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh okay I got to admit I wasn't\Nexpecting that I must have made a mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the ingredients somehow guess\NI shouldn't have used frog extract?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry there. My\Nmistake. Hiriluk! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.96,0:05:13.33,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,476)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(432,474,\1a&H00&)\t(3894,3936,\1a&HFF&)}Dr. Kureha (133 Years Old){Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 2,0:05:08.96,0:05:13.33,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,476)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\3c&HFFFFFE&\c&HFFFFFE&\1a&HFF&\t(432,474,\1a&H00&)\t(3894,4144,\1a&HFF&)\4a&HFF&}Dr. Kureha (133 Years Old){Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 3,0:05:08.96,0:05:13.33,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(474,476)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&HFFFFFE&\4a&HFF&}Dr. Kureha (133 Years Old){Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.00,0:05:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you happy now? Quack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.15,0:05:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunt has reached its final stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.90,0:05:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you and I are the only\Nones left in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol has his hunters desperately\Nlooking for us everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.58,0:05:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if they weren't, you'd\Nalready be a pariah in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.32,0:05:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're the worst quack of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.00,0:05:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna get caught\Nby some fool doctor hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.82,0:05:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one day I'll end up saving\Nthis country with medical science.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you mean destroy this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there are people on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.82,0:05:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around, quack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not if I see you first,\Nyou thieving sawbones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those tin soldiers\Naren't gonna capture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go on helping\Nthe sick and the injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've been shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.30,0:06:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to stop the bleeding\Nright away or you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're pretty lucky because\NI just created an ointment
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three days ago that even\Nworks on broken bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let that shoot him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what are you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look like Like a human being,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.38,0:06:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must be that Yeti everyone\Nis talking about in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't enough! Finish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who do you think you're\Ndealing with, creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not gonna shoot you, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Hiriluk, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.52,0:07:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk, and I wanna help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the first encounter\Nbetween Chopper and Dr. Hiriluk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Between Chopper and Dr. Hiriluk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why have you kept silent?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd hate me if I talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I talked to humans the\Nother day, they shot at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, people think\NI'm a freak for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you can talk, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even children learn to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see what's damn special about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Front chopper! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I thought for sure that would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.56,0:09:31.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at least your head was\Nbandaged to begin with, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you call me Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.10,0:09:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's your new name, Tony Tony Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I picked it because I\Nthought you'd look like you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.32,0:09:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could chop down a tree\Nwith those antlers of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.34,0:09:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool name, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that's what I'm gonna call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always pay close attention\Nto your patient's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,symptoms and give them proper treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the way to save a person's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.14,0:10:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are sick people who need my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you crazy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought lizard eyeballs would work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.54,0:10:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.28,0:10:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Waffle's guards, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, it's time to use the decoy plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The what plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You almost got me killed,\Nyou maniac! So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You already cheated death once,\Nyou clumsy Pluno's caribou!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.76,0:10:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Darren!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.67,0:10:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call me Pluno!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:10:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, that's the first time\NI've ever fought with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.30,0:11:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.88,0:11:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to have an opponent to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.44,0:11:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is it your first time for this as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A gift as a memento of our making up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gift?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know Chopper, it\Nsometimes feels that things
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are pretty rough but\Ntry not to hold a grudge
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,against us humans okay\Nthis country is sick right
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.40,0:11:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now the people and the\Nking both suffer from a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.68,0:11:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,terrible sickness of the\Nheart the conventional
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.82,0:11:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wisdom has it that there\Nis no way to cure a sick
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,country but that's wrong\Nonce my invention has been
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perfected this country\Nwill be as good is saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, there used to be a master thief\Nwho lived in a country in the far west.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.82,0:12:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had a serious heart condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He went to the greatest doctors he\Ncould find to receive treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no one was able to cure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They told him he was going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frustrated and depressed, he\Npassed by a certain mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he saw something\Nhe had never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blossoms!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He saw cherry blossoms\Nall over the mountainside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.60,0:12:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then he went to see another doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And got the shock of his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.92,0:12:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he was told,\Nyou're perfectly healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was cured. It was a\Nmiracle. Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it also makes perfect\Nsense medically speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By changing his emotional state,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.18,0:12:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was able to change his\Nphysical state somehow too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that's true, There's no disease\Nin this world that can't be cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.10,0:13:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them laugh at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.86,0:13:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My medical skills will\Nsave this country yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's why I raised\Nthis skull and crossbones
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a challenge to all the\Ndiseases of the world. Skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.44,0:13:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This symbolizes my belief\Nthat nothing is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will save this country\Nwith my doctor's skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.08,0:13:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By raising this flag, I vow to\Nfight just like the pirates do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, reindeer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Join us and be our friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love being a pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, what are pirates? Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dashing swashbucklers of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With great strength and\Nthe eyesight of eagles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their voices echo like rolling thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:14:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're really a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.93,0:14:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, of course I am It's\Nlike I've been saying all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do all kinds of fun stuff,\Nlike fishing and singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.70,0:14:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure we do, and sometimes we dance,\Ntoo You call that being a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.90,0:14:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we go on adventures! Really do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates really do go on adventures?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you bet we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates risk their lives to go on adventures,\Nand you meet the most amazing people!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.06,0:14:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great to be a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most amazing people sail the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, someday you've got\Nto go to sea. If you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.80,0:14:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll realize just how\Nsmall your problems really
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are in comparison to the\Nvastness of the oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island you were born on is\Nlike this compared to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.02,0:14:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's smaller, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.08,0:14:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your destiny lies beyond that shining sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The good times passed in\Nthe twinkling of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It finally came time to say farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.08,0:15:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it always does in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's taken a year, but your\Ntreatment is finally complete.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.49,0:15:31.41,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)}One Year Later
Dialogue: 2,0:15:27.49,0:15:31.41,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\3c&HFFFFFE&\c&HFFFFFE&\1a&HFF&\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}One Year Later
Dialogue: 3,0:15:27.49,0:15:31.41,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(479,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&HFFFFFE&\4a&HFF&}One Year Later
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:33.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your injuries are healed, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.92,0:15:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.44,0:15:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.72,0:15:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your way have a nice life i'm busy\Nwith my research so hit the bricks
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm no longer under Any obligation\Nto care for you doctor i swear i
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't cause you any trouble if you\Njust let me Stay with you i'll rub
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your shoulders every day i'll make\Nyou tea and clean the house Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.68,0:16:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have anywhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:29.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hurt my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.76,0:16:31.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Min-Jade!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.88,0:16:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.90,0:16:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to sea if you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go anywhere you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many days do I have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, this isn't a charity award.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have the money to pay my fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't kill a person with\Na tranquilizer gun you know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll tell you. Ten days\Nfrom now, you'll die. So now you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.34,0:17:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten that'll be enough in two days my\Nresearch will be done now completed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After failing for, I will make cherry\Nblossoms bloom in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.78,0:18:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you've wasted 30 years\Nresearching freaking cherry blossoms?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what your big project has been?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same cherry blossoms you think saved
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your life back when you\Nwere a master thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.16,0:18:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a winter island where\Nit's bitter cold year round.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No cherry blossom will ever bloom here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.94,0:18:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was nothing but a worthless criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.62,0:18:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the very brink of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.20,0:18:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but those flowers saved my life\Nand transformed my existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:31.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every human being in\Nthis world can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.78,0:18:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to prove it right here\Nin Drum, the land where I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize that what\Nyou're saying has no basis
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.86,0:18:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in medical science or any\Nother field of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you do get them to\Nbloom, there's no medicinal use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, you and I are\Nalike, so before I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll at least teach you that\Nnothing is impossible in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.74,0:19:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that you can do anything if you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, the story of these two outcasts\Ndoesn't have a happy fairy tale ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That scent. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he found out Heroic\Nonly had 10 days to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper got very upset,\Nas you might imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then he decided to take\Naction the only way he knew how.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you, I will make\Ncherry blossoms bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This symbolizes my belief\Nthat nothing is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.32,0:20:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight like pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.74,0:20:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, why have so many\Nguards been missing lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the 20MDs have them\Nout picking mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mushrooms? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The doctors think there's some kind\Nof mushroom that can cure anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.80,0:20:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they've got the other\Nguards out looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.04,0:20:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll spot us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, did you hear what they said?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm not going to shoot you, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.84,0:21:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go where you want, but don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.74,0:21:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did a terrible thing to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at least you'll\Nsee my cherry blossoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be my last great work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.76,0:21:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, one more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.95,0:22:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.08,0:22:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing is impossible for a\Nman who raises the pirate flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't that what I told you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.74,0:22:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep on fighting,\Njust like the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.52,0:22:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Alto Mushroom. That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I get across?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.08,0:23:18.25,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}One Week Later{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 2,0:23:16.08,0:23:18.25,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\3c&HFFFFFE&\c&HFFFFFE&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}One Week Later{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 3,0:23:16.08,0:23:18.25,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&HFFFFFE&\4a&HFF&}One Week Later{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.52,0:23:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I lost one\Nof your precious books.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.14,0:23:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good Lord, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.00,0:23:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.30,0:23:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.66,0:24:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An amyadaki mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.14,0:24:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Liv.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.46,0:24:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please teach me to be a doctor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.92,0:24:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll fight, and I won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.48,0:24:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.22,0:24:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think a reindeer can?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.64,0:24:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be a wonderful doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.08,0:24:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, I can't breathe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.08,0:24:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you'll be a wonderful doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.22,0:24:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you have such a kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.82,0:24:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chess, Kuromaiimo, is hunting the\Ndoctors? Proceeding according to my plan?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:48.59,0:24:51.26,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,725)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)}King Wapol\NDrum
Dialogue: 2,0:24:48.59,0:24:51.26,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,725)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(439,481,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}King Wapol\NDrum
Dialogue: 3,0:24:48.59,0:24:51.26,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(481,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,725)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}King Wapol\NDrum
Dialogue: 1,0:24:51.30,0:24:55.97,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord3.25\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx65\fscy70\pos(440,650)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Kuromarimo\NDrum Bailiff
Dialogue: 2,0:24:51.30,0:24:55.97,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx65\fscy70\pos(440,650)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Kuromarimo\NDrum Bailiff
Dialogue: 3,0:24:51.30,0:24:55.97,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx65\fscy70\pos(440,650)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Kuromarimo\NDrum Bailiff
Dialogue: 1,0:24:51.30,0:24:55.97,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord3.25\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx65\fscy70\pos(1074,650)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)}Chess\NDrum Councilor
Dialogue: 2,0:24:51.30,0:24:55.97,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx65\fscy70\pos(1074,650)\3c&HF9F9FA&\c&HF9F9FA&\1a&HFF&\t(440,482,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Chess\NDrum Councilor
Dialogue: 3,0:24:51.30,0:24:55.97,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(482,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx65\fscy70\pos(1074,650)\c&HF9F9FA&\4a&HFF&}Chess\NDrum Councilor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.96,0:24:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, nearly all the doctors have\Nbeen exiled, sir. Nearly all?
Dialogue: 1,0:24:56.02,0:24:59.19,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,0)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,725)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(433,475,\1a&H00&)}Dalton\NDrum Royal Guard Captain{Ravenfire/PJ/Gaijin}
Dialogue: 2,0:24:56.02,0:24:59.19,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,725)\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&\t(433,475,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Dalton\NDrum Royal Guard Captain{Ravenfire/PJ/Gaijin}
Dialogue: 3,0:24:56.02,0:24:59.19,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(475,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,725)\c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&}Dalton\NDrum Royal Guard Captain{Ravenfire/PJ/Gaijin}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.28,0:24:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are two that still elude us, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.20,0:25:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old crone, Dr. Kureha.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.82,0:25:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that crazy quack, here he'll look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.20,0:25:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.50,0:25:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just had a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.74,0:25:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Send a notice to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.06,0:25:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them that the 20 MDs\Nhave all fallen gravely ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.32,0:25:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's the mushroom soup? Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.46,0:25:23.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.62,0:25:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This reeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.04,0:25:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No living creature could eat this soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.32,0:25:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.38,0:25:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.28,0:25:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good medicine never tastes good, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.74,0:25:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just means it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.32,0:25:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the soup, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.72,0:25:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.90,0:25:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've finally done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.68,0:25:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.96,0:26:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.50,0:26:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting 30 years for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.90,0:26:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've done it, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.58,0:26:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My research is a success!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.96,0:26:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.87,0:26:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was right all along! See that? See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.38,0:26:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.50,0:26:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.28,0:26:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can make cherry blossoms\Nbloom on this winter island!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.86,0:26:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going out, but you stay put\Nand rest. Okay. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.78,0:26:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.02,0:26:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I cured a human's disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to become a great doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.54,0:26:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.66,0:27:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You realize this entire country\Nis a madhouse right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.76,0:27:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.68,0:27:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you heard about\Nthe 20 MDs falling ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.52,0:27:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what a crock.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.42,0:27:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what brings you here today?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.66,0:27:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.80,0:27:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse. Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.46,0:27:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't even asked it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.92,0:27:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what is this dust supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.02,0:27:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dust is 30 years of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.18,0:27:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the discovery I've\Nbeen searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.22,0:27:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll treat this country's\Nsickness, and it'll cure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.48,0:27:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just wasted 30 years\Nof your life. Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.64,0:27:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, why are you showing it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.08,0:27:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to make enough dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.76,0:27:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.67,0:27:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to make cherry\Nblossoms bloom for me. Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.32,0:27:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I waste my - I'm not finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.70,0:27:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to teach\NChopper about medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.14,0:27:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to be a doctor\Nmore than anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.34,0:27:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.28,0:27:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He may be a reindeer and a freak,\Nbut I know he'll make a great doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.90,0:27:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a good kid with a kind heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.48,0:28:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He risked his life to\Nmake medicine for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please help him become a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.52,0:28:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've sure got a lot of nerve you quack.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.22,0:28:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I take care of your\Nhalf-baked research and your weird pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.12,0:28:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know me,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.12,0:28:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not the type to get\Nall sentimental just
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.96,0:28:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because someone has a short time to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.72,0:28:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get out of my tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.10,0:28:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.12,0:28:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've known each other a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.82,0:28:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.02,0:28:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't seem like you here, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.48,0:28:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To give up so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.78,0:28:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.06,0:28:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he couldn't mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.74,0:28:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.08,0:28:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 20MDs are ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.94,0:28:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who will treat the country's sick people?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.86,0:28:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least give us medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.34,0:28:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no good talking to us.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:45.54,0:28:49.08,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord4\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)}Ropeway Station Four
Dialogue: 2,0:28:45.54,0:28:49.08,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord0.5\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\3c&HFFFFFE&\c&HFFFFFE&\1a&HFF&\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)\4a&HFF&}Ropeway Station Four
Dialogue: 3,0:28:45.54,0:28:49.08,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fad(476,0)\an2\bord0\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fscx75\fscy80\pos(720,785)\c&HFFFFFE&\4a&HFF&}Ropeway Station Four
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.02,0:28:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.93,0:28:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.34,0:28:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.72,0:28:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.32,0:28:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head for the ropeway.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.36,0:28:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.48,0:29:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's that damn fool here alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.38,0:29:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, for crying out loud,\Nyou don't have to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.56,0:29:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.20,0:29:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where'd that quack run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.18,0:29:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.86,0:29:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor got better, so he went\Ninto town. That's all. Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.80,0:29:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His condition can't be cured by any\Ntreatment known to modern medical science.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.50,0:29:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.56,0:29:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.84,0:29:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's all better now, because\NI gave him this to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.70,0:29:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.46,0:29:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an all-purpose\Nmedicine, so he's fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.28,0:29:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.19,0:29:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he felt like\Nhe was full of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.52,0:29:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor said he was going to\Nteach me to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.10,0:29:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.98,0:29:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.80,0:29:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mushroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.42,0:29:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.58,0:30:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you eat it, you're\Ndead in half a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.76,0:30:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why that idiot came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.14,0:30:11.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.48,0:30:13.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I checked in one of doctors' books.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.58,0:30:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I Guess I lost the book somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.54,0:30:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can defeat all diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.40,0:30:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I raised this flag as a challenge\Nto all The diseases of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.02,0:30:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.00,0:30:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a skull next to the\Npicture of the amyodaki mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.14,0:30:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And doctor said he got better.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.14,0:30:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.56,0:30:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.06,0:30:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop dawdling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.18,0:30:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.44,0:30:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't got any time left to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.62,0:30:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was touched by the\Nkindness in Your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.40,0:30:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The skull in that book\Nmeans poison. Understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.82,0:30:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.73,0:30:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.84,0:30:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no known Medicine in this\Nworld that can work for all diseases.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.98,0:30:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why doctors exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.12,0:30:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you Can't save\Npeople with just kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.22,0:31:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really want to save\Nthem, you need medical skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.46,0:31:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the training to use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.34,0:31:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without that, you can't save anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.44,0:31:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Wapol, Hiriluk is\Nheaded towards the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.46,0:31:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.60,0:31:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.02,0:31:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.86,0:31:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.96,0:31:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.04,0:31:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll never return to this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.42,0:31:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he chose the\Ncastle to be his tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.28,0:31:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand that you take me to the patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.86,0:31:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come to save the 20 MDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.10,0:31:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.70,0:32:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.70,0:32:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.61,0:32:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.54,0:32:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.92,0:32:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 20 MDs are fine as you can see!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.56,0:32:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.56,0:32:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,life in danger here is yours, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.62,0:32:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.53,0:32:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did he come here? Guards! Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.66,0:32:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that That was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.86,0:32:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.32,0:32:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And none of them are sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.48,0:32:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.16,0:32:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was a national crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.52,0:32:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.08,0:32:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, it was just a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.46,0:32:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.37,0:32:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it really was a national crisis,\NI wouldn't want someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.22,0:32:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignore his babbling! Execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.56,0:32:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save your bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.84,0:32:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have what it takes\Nto kill someone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.90,0:33:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, when do you think a person dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.86,0:33:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When a bullet from a pistol\Npierces his heart? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.34,0:33:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he's attacked by\Nan incurable disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.76,0:33:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.18,0:33:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he eats a soup of deadly\Npoisonous mushrooms? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.78,0:33:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man dies when people forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.32,0:33:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I should disappear right\Nnow, my dream will come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.02,0:33:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when it does, the citizen's sickness\Nof the heart will be cured as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.84,0:33:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.84,0:33:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.76,0:33:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true for a country?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.92,0:33:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if the will to do it is passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.82,0:33:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Dalton!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.06,0:33:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.04,0:33:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very shortly a monster will be coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.80,0:33:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.10,0:33:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.42,0:34:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.12,0:34:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mushroom won't kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.52,0:34:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had a marvelous life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.20,0:34:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Quack.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.30,0:34:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.04,0:34:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He blew himself off!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.54,0:34:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.12,0:34:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! Look at that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.44,0:34:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.98,0:34:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.89,0:34:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.54,0:35:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.78,0:35:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave here at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.44,0:35:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't even defeat me,\Nyou can't possibly defeat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.74,0:35:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for those who had the\Nnerve to laugh at Hera Luke's death!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.96,0:35:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without enough strength,\Nyou'd only die in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.92,0:35:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.50,0:35:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't sacrifice it for this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.78,0:35:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.64,0:35:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.14,0:35:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only man who cared\Nenough to try to cure
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.42,0:35:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this sick country has just\Ndied while you laughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.28,0:35:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even while everyone else\Njust gave up in despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.04,0:35:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kind doctor attempted to save us\Nall and died for it. So what if someone
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.28,0:36:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like that dies, I've seen the path this\Ncountry should take. It should just die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.22,0:36:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out as long as we stay here it can't\Nbe rebuilt because even if medical care
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.44,0:36:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Progresses even if medical research goes\Non there is no medicine that can cure
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.12,0:36:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.03,0:36:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd let you have your say, and\Nall you've done is make me angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.14,0:36:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.05,0:36:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please teach me how to be a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.58,0:36:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to teach me\Nhow to become a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.00,0:36:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.91,0:36:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll become the all-purpose medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.78,0:36:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll become a doctor\Nwho can cure anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.20,0:36:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.14,0:36:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even cure a country!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.70,0:36:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you ask of me,\Nbut I've got to become a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.30,0:36:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I know there's no disease, no\Nillness in this world that can't be cured!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.46,0:36:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.98,0:36:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.24,0:37:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't die. I'll carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.98,0:37:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.16,0:37:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So for the six years since then, Chopper's\Nbeen studying medicine under you. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.74,0:37:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Rain! Dr. Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.80,0:37:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dr. Rain! There's trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.58,0:37:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.40,0:37:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.56,0:37:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.86,0:37:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy with the annoying
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.72,0:37:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mouth! I have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.74,0:37:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, at long last, we shall\Nrestore the Kingdom of Drum.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.20,0:37:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wobbles, sir Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.88,0:37:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on top of the castle Why
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.38,0:37:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is that strange flag flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.08,0:38:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an outrage Where's the\Nflag of the Drum Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.66,0:38:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old thing, I burned it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Kureha, the last survivor of our Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.22,0:38:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Han, get out of my castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.70,0:38:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This castle is no longer yours, Wapol!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.26,0:38:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It saw enough corruption and\Nmisery during your reign!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.34,0:38:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.28,0:38:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just here, the country too!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.40,0:38:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drum Kingdom has already died out, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.94,0:38:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.28,0:38:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.48,0:38:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.88,0:39:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you are with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.48,0:39:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've grown stronger,\Nhaving you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.44,0:39:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've started on an everlasting ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.70,0:39:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm invincible when your love is near.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.88,0:39:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm with you I have no fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.44,0:39:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see how far we can make this go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.80,0:39:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.08,0:39:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use your pride. I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.08,0:39:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.84,0:39:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glistening like water.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.54,0:39:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the sun rises in the dawn?

